// Halberd moveset (WP-052). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes": wide sweeps at range, medium speed, 2.9 m reach, Might.
// Frame numbers are tuning unless a spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are
// shared in common.ron; the critical pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's
// crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
